# Embereth Veteran's target is "another target creature", not "another creature you control" (CR 115.1): Bot1 puts the Young Hero
# Role on Bot2's Memnite. Bot1 controls the Role token (CR 111.2: the token's creator controls it), Bot2 controls the creature, and
# the Role's granted ability is the creature's: on Bot2's turn the Memnite (1/1, toughness 1 is 3 or less) attacks and gets a
# +1/+1 counter (CR 303.4e, 113.6).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Embereth Veteran
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Embereth Veteran.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Embereth Veteran.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Young Hero.AttachedTo = Memnite
? Bot2.Battlefield = Memnite
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Memnite > Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain; Young Hero
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 2
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Toughness = 2
